>Reeder</surname><given-names>BA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Dose-response issues concerning physical activity and health: an evidence-based symposium</article-title><source>Med Sci Sports Exerc</source><year>2001</year><volume>33</volume><fpage>S351</fpage><lpage>8</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11427759</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B11"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Chobanian</surname><given-names>AV</given-names></name><name><surname>Bakris</surname><given-names>GL</given-names></name><name><surname>Black</surname><given-names>HR</given-names></name><name><surname>Cushman</surname><given-names>WC</given-names></name><name><surname>Green</surname><given-names>LA</given-names></name><name><surname>Izzo</surname><given-names>JL</given-names><suffix>Jr.</suffix></name><name><surname>Jones</surname><given-names>DW</given-names></name><name><surname>Materson</surname><given-names>BJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Oparil</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Wright</surname><given-names>JT</given-names><suffix>Jr.</suffix></name><name><surname>Roccella</surname><given-names>EJ</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The Seventh Report of the Joint National Committee on Prevention, Detection, Evaluation, and Treatment of High Blood Pressure: the JNC 7 report</article-title><source>JAMA</source><year>2003</year><volume>289</volume><fpage>2560</fpage><lpage>2572</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12748199</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1001/jama.289.19.2560</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B12"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Nafziger</surname><given-names>AN</given-names></name><name><surname>Jenkins</surname><given-names>PL</given-names></name><name><surname>Stenlund</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Wall</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surna